			'slight ventral projection of the glenoid pedicle, small plate-like paroccipital process posteroventrally orientated, very slight development and ventral projection of the mastoid apophysis'
			'glenoid pedicle more developed and more ventrally projected than in state 1, reduced paroccipital process which only forms a short posteriorly orientated projection, mastoid apophysis more developed than in state 1, its ventral border lower than the ventral surface of the basioccipital and basisphenoid'
			'great development and ventral projection of the glenoid pedicle which lies lower than the ventral basicranial surface, very reduced paroccipital process, great development and ventral projection of the mastoid apophysis, which is much lower than the ventral basicranial surface'
